# Keep every text file LF in the repository and in the container image. The
# fork is developed on Windows, where git would otherwise commit CRLF for new
# files, and a CRLF shell script fails on Linux with "bad interpreter".
* text=auto eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
Makefile text eol=lf
Dockerfile text eol=lf

# Binary
*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.jpg binary
